{"title":"1976 AHSME Problems/Problem 29","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem_29\">Problem 29</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1976_AHSME_Problems/Problem_29&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem 29\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Ann and Barbara were comparing their ages and found that Barbara is as old as Ann was when Barbara was as old as \nAnn had been when Barbara was half as old as Ann is. If the sum of their present ages is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/b/4/5b45828f292e161290be6ee62bc4c9df081ee1e1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$44$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> years, then Ann's age is\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/9/2/892c093833f22812b8e31e17335733cbd4513932.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A) }22\\qquad \\textbf{(B) }24\\qquad \\textbf{(C) }25\\qquad \\textbf{(D) }26\\qquad  \\textbf{(E) }28$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"398\" height=\"17\" /> \n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1976_AHSME_Problems/Problem_29&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>This problem is very wordy. Nonetheless, let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/3/8136a7ef6a03334a7246df9097e5bcc31ba33fd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"14\" /> be Ann and Barbara's current ages, respectively. We are given that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/f/6/ef61cdb320b39b83cf9392b5cf0065b7c28d285f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a+b=44$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"82\" height=\"14\" />. Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/2/092e364e1d9d19ad5fffb0b46ef4cc7f2da02c1c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" /> equal the difference between their ages, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/3/e/73e033d462d891ce341cd59b1f35e6045e141fb5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y=a-b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"73\" height=\"16\" />. Know that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/2/092e364e1d9d19ad5fffb0b46ef4cc7f2da02c1c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" /> is constant because the difference between their ages will always be the same.\n</p><p>Now, let's tackle the equation: <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/e/9/de99aa1df7e9779a37e5e33ab794f1fd10a825ed.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b=$\" width=\"26\" height=\"12\" /> Ann's age when Barbara was Ann's age when Barbara was <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/a/f/9afddc3c61aa4e66d003d0c7cc5bd01560d341f6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{a}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"15\" height=\"34\" />. When Barbara was <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/a/f/9afddc3c61aa4e66d003d0c7cc5bd01560d341f6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{a}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"15\" height=\"34\" /> years old, Ann was <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/d/dcd3bcf90c7b10ec25230b8aaa23bb350de19e14.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{a}{2}+y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"45\" height=\"33\" /> years old. So the equation becomes <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/e/9/de99aa1df7e9779a37e5e33ab794f1fd10a825ed.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b=$\" width=\"26\" height=\"12\" /> Ann's age when Barbara was <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/d/dcd3bcf90c7b10ec25230b8aaa23bb350de19e14.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{a}{2}+y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"45\" height=\"33\" />. Adding on their age difference again, we get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/a/b/aab602a57bbf8602cca34e6b3c949ba56c5d59c6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b = \\frac{a}{2} + y + y \\Rightarrow b = \\frac{a}{2} + 2y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"226\" height=\"34\" />. Substitute <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/a/6/5a697bfdeadf2105048670e6f6c7d4dc6878dc4f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a-b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"41\" height=\"16\" /> back in for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/2/092e364e1d9d19ad5fffb0b46ef4cc7f2da02c1c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" /> to get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/8/6/9861d91ecb430511a3830eb3ae17f8f8f4014aad.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b = \\frac{a}{2} + 2(a-b)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"129\" height=\"33\" />. Simplify: <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/4/e/04e38e0ab5197d03917ab40e1cc403f4043b5b52.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2b = a + 4(a-b) \\Rightarrow 6b = 5a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"224\" height=\"18\" />. Solving <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/3/8136a7ef6a03334a7246df9097e5bcc31ba33fd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"14\" /> in terms of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" />, we have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/0/e/80e1d43718db04d3f79ab11174df1d17c2431646.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b = \\frac{5a}{6}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"53\" height=\"37\" />. Substitute that back into the first equation of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/f/6/ef61cdb320b39b83cf9392b5cf0065b7c28d285f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a+b=44$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"82\" height=\"14\" /> to get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/7/7c717cfe7be849f75ef0e36287beb55a0d68da85.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{11a}{6}=44$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"74\" height=\"37\" />. Solve for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" />, and the answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/7/d/e7df2f280a7170afb7f3952bd86b64f6be810f23.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(B) }24}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"64\" height=\"28\" />. ~<a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/index.php/User:Jiang147369\">jiang147369</a>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1976_AHSME_Problems/Problem_29&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1976_AHSME\" title=\"1976 AHSME\">1976 AHSME</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1976_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1976 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1976_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1976 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1976\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" ro